WEBVTT
Kind: captions

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.710 position:63%
A fly buzzes past your face.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.530 position:63%
You don't even think. You just...

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:06.490 position:63%
catch it.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.950 position:63%
Your friend knocks his coffee off the table.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.330 position:63%
The cup hasn't even started to fall...

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.280 position:63%
and your hand is already under it.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.650 position:63%
How... how did you do that?

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.470 position:63%
A normal human reacts in about a quarter of a second.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.610 position:63%
You react in two and a half hundredths.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:37.380 position:63%
So what if your reaction time was ten times faster?

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.110 position:63%
Here's how it works.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:46.230 position:63%
Your eyes see, your brain decides, your muscles move.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.990 position:63%
Your brain got ten times faster.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:50.830 position:63%
Your muscles did not.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.480 position:63%
You can't move faster... you just start earlier.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:57.310 position:63%
The ruler test.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.680 position:63%
A normal person lets it drop thirty centimeters.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:02.990 position:63%
You?

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:04.840 position:63%
Three millimeters.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:06.820 position:63%
That's...

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:08.570 position:63%
not humanly possible.

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:18.050 position:63%
To you, the whole world moves in slow motion.

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:19.730 position:63%
A falling flowerpot?

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:25.970 position:63%
Caught.

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:27.740 position:63%
Whoa...

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:32.770 position:63%
Your phone slips out of your pocket.

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:34.670 position:63%
Caught.

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:36.620 position:63%
Somebody throws a ball at your head.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:39.450 position:63%
Caught that too.

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:48.500 position:63%
A car runs a red light.

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:50.770 position:63%
Everyone else freezes.

00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:52.400 position:63%
You've already stepped back.

00:01:57.820 --> 00:01:58.670 position:63%
Online games?

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.090 position:63%
While the other players are still seeing you,

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:03.250 position:63%
you've already aimed,

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:03.890 position:63%
shot,

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:04.700 position:63%
and moved.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:09.010 position:63%
Thirty wins in a row.

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:11.020 position:63%
They think I'm cheating.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.300 position:63%
But where it gets really crazy... is sports.

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:22.860 position:63%
A table tennis smash crosses the table in a fifth of a second.

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:24.470 position:63%
Normal players guess.

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:25.250 position:63%
You don't.

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:29.290 position:63%
You watch the ball leave the paddle, and you're already there.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:37.170 position:63%
Twenty-one to zero.

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:39.480 position:63%
Who Is this kid?

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:42.910 position:63%
Baseball.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:49.150 position:63%
A hundred-and-sixty-kilometer fastball reaches the plate in four tenths of a second.

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:51.830 position:63%
Pros have to decide before it's halfway there.

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:53.940 position:63%
You watch it the whole way...

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:56.480 position:63%
and crush it.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:03.030 position:63%
Boxing.

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.310 position:63%
You see every punch coming.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:10.380 position:63%
Nobody can touch you.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.150 position:63%
Okay. I give up.

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:31.210 position:63%
But the sport that changes your life is football.

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:35.100 position:63%
A penalty reaches the goal in under half a second.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:37.510 position:63%
Normal keepers guess a side.

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:39.800 position:63%
You wait, watch the ball...

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:42.050 position:63%
and go.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:46.920 position:63%
A perfect shot into the top corner is still out of reach.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:48.810 position:63%
Everything else?

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:49.600 position:63%
Saved.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:53.420 position:63%
Nine out of ten?! Pack your bags.

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:55.090 position:63%
You're going to the national team.

00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:00.210 position:63%
Eleven games, not a single goal conceded.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.270 position:63%
Fans are calling him The Wall.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:05.880 position:63%
Nobody is that fast without cheating.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:07.020 position:63%
So they test you.

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:10.280 position:63%
No drugs. No tricks.

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:12.590 position:63%
His brain is just... faster.

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:15.680 position:63%
They even try you in the hundred-meter sprint.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:17.660 position:63%
Bang!

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:20.130 position:63%
You're gone before anyone else moves.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:23.220 position:63%
False start! Disqualified!

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:24.490 position:63%
It's a real rule.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:29.090 position:63%
React faster than a tenth of a second, and they decide you must have guessed.

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:30.940 position:63%
And there's a cost.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:33.780 position:63%
The world feels slow.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:35.810 position:63%
Movies feel like slideshows.

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:36.980 position:63%
Headaches.

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:38.340 position:63%
Endless hunger.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:40.640 position:63%
You're bored again, aren't you?

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:43.790 position:63%
Everything's just so... slow.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.610 position:63%
Two years later. The World Cup final.

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:52.960 position:63%
A hundred and twenty minutes, still zero to zero.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:54.050 position:63%
Penalties.

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:56.000 position:63%
Save.

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:56.950 position:63%
Save.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.280 position:63%
Goal — top corner, nobody could stop it.

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:01.110 position:63%
Save again.

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:02.750 position:63%
One last kick.

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:06.360 position:63%
Save it, and your country wins the World Cup.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:10.030 position:63%
The striker runs up.

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:14.280 position:63%
And in that same moment, you see something nobody else sees.

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.320 position:63%
The cable holding the TV camera snaps.

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:19.410 position:63%
Right below it... the ball boy.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:21.130 position:63%
Huh?

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:23.650 position:63%
Half a second.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.810 position:63%
You're the only person in the stadium with time to choose.

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:29.840 position:63%
The ball...

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:31.530 position:63%
or the boy.

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:44.420 position:63%
Behind you, the ball rolls into the empty net.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.150 position:63%
You just lost the World Cup final.

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:50.150 position:63%
Eighty thousand people go silent.

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:54.720 position:63%
Then the replay comes up on the giant screen...

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:58.460 position:63%
and one by one, they stand up and start clapping.

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:02.370 position:63%
Mate.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:05.200 position:63%
You just won something bigger.

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:12.410 position:63%
He lost the World Cup.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:14.180 position:63%
But he saved a life.

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:19.410 position:63%
Tonight the whole world is talking about the goalkeeper who chose a boy over a trophy.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.080 position:63%
So... you lost the final.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:26.500 position:63%
There's a World Cup every four years.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:28.310 position:63%
There's only one of that kid.

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:34.160 position:63%
Three days later, a long black car stops outside your house.

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.570 position:63%
We've been watching you.

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:45.260 position:63%
How would you like to test your reflexes on something... a lot faster than a football?

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:47.070 position:63%
Faster than a football?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:48.050 position:63%
Like what?

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:49.800 position:63%
Get in the car.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:55.660 position:63%
And with a brain ten times faster... you'd already made up your mind before he finished the sentence.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:01.670 position:63%
So what would you do with a brain ten times faster?

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:05.020 position:63%
Tell us which sport you'd dominate in the comments.

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:11.050 position:63%
And if you'd have jumped for that kid too... hit like, and subscribe for more What Ifs.

